      "label": "coach_teacher_health_randomtalk_00",
      "hash64": "D5F669A548795B9A",
      "text": "Have you ever used one of those healing\\nmachines in the Terarium?\\c\\nI hear you can operate them yourself and heal up\\nyour party, right? Reminds me of my Pokémon\\r\\nCenter days![VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
